Report read errors in ts.
A read error ends the line reader's input just as end of file does, and
ts never checked the error flag of standard input, so it stopped quietly
with status 0. Die with an error message when the input loop ended
because of a read error.

---
 miscutils/ts.c |    1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/miscutils/ts.c
+++ b/miscutils/ts.c
@@ -93,5 +93,6 @@
 		free(line);
 	}
 
+	die_if_ferror(stdin, bb_msg_standard_input);
 	return EXIT_SUCCESS;
 }
